sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Chargewire server
  C->>S: POST /chargewire/v1/sessions {"options": {…}}
  S-->>C: 201 session_id, options, transaction, idle_timeout_s
  C->>S: PATCH /chargewire/v1/sessions/{id} {"options": {…}}
  S-->>C: 200 every option, and "errors" by option name
  C->>S: statements, results, prepared statements, ingest
  S-->>C: …
  C->>S: GET /chargewire/v1/sessions/{id}
  S-->>C: 200 current options and transaction (a cheap liveness probe)
  C->>S: DELETE /chargewire/v1/sessions/{id}
  S-->>C: 204, running statements cancelled, retained results freed
  C->>S: GET /chargewire/v1/sessions/{id}
  S-->>C: 404 session_not_found (never re-created)
